# pnpm config for Spotify Clone
#
# The postinstall-script allowlist (which dependencies are allowed to run build
# scripts) lives in pnpm-workspace.yaml under `allowBuilds` — that's the
# canonical location in pnpm 10+. The old `.npmrc` `onlyBuiltDependencies[]`
# syntax is deprecated and was removed.
#
# Approved packages (see pnpm-workspace.yaml): prisma, @prisma/client,
# @prisma/engines, esbuild, sharp. They need postinstall to download native
# binaries or generate the typed client.
